12.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/28/6681663/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下校時の外の空気が\nとても過ごしやすい。\n少し寒くなって秋の匂いがします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな私は\n栗きんとんを作ろうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年も大量の栗を剥いて作ったの。\n甘さ控えめで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなもやってみよう！\n栗をつぶすの楽しいよっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/28/6681663/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにねねとゆっくりしたの\n買い物したしいっぱいしゃべった！\nおでこきれい過ぎて惚れ直しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこは\nハロウィンパーティー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ロリータロリータ\nしつこいですかね。\nかわいいもん、あぶりさーもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/28/6681663/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとはこのくらいの\nメイクしたかったぜー\nゴス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38965":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"しーちゃんと仲良くなりました！\nごはん行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/06/03/9583898/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと乃木坂メンバーで一番\n性格が似てた＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりますわかります～の応酬。\nこんなに共感できる人\n今まで出会ったことないレベル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3時間半お喋りノンストップだったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しーちゃんめちゃめちゃ良い子♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくしっかりしてて、\n色んなこと考えてて、\n周りにも気配りがちゃんとできて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポジティブな答えを自分で導き出して\n前向きに頑張ってる姿に凄く尊敬しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい・ありがとうは\n素敵な言葉だから\n何回使ってもいいと私は思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、瞳が本当にキラキラしてた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しーちゃんありがとう♡\nまたお話しようね～＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6/21発売 blt graph. vol20\n撮影してきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装も解禁OK頂いたので一枚貼りますね\n「不等号」MV撮った古民家で\n懐かしかった～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/06/03/9583898/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はらじらー！聞いてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールはこちらから！\nhttp://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-13675":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013.08.21"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46結成2周年"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日が私の更新日って\n何か運命を感じる。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2年前の8月21日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな子が何人受かったのか\n気になって気になって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時は自分が落ちてしまったから\n悔しい思いでいっぱいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一年後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかヲタクになっているとは(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてさらに一年後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか乃木坂46研究生として\nブログを書いているとは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生何が起きるか\n分かりませんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年からはメンバーとして\nがんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生も加わって大所帯となった\n乃木坂46の三年目"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援よろしくお願い致します☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8/11個別握手会に\nお越し下さった皆様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽわんとしたワンピに\nお団子ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会やはり\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方には\n私が全力で楽しんでたの\nすごくすごく\n伝わってしまったはず(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休憩中に怜奈が書いてくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貰った瞬間濡れた手で持ってしまい\n滲んだのは申し訳ない(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イラストとかちゃちゃっと\n描けるの憧れるぅぅぅ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと撮りたかった写メを\n撮ってきましたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼伊藤伊藤伊藤伊藤／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼(総称して)ドルヲタ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもたくさん\n撮っていただいたから\n少しずつ出していくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと一期生との絡みを書くと..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さんと話して\nりんご姫様と呼ばせて\nいただくにことになった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかさん生駒さんと\nお洋服の話たくさんした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々さんが優しい優しすぎる//"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9/1京都個握も\n楽しみにしています(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂で1番好きな衣装\n(女の子だったら\n着てみたいものでも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お聞かせください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみましょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼二期生を一期生で例えると？／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログの次回予告で\n乃木ヲタから見た二期生の素顔\nと書いたんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"素顔\"ってファンのみなさんが\n探って行くのが楽しいと思うので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生を一期生で例えると？\nに変えましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スミマセン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それに、これのがきっと\n分かりやすいですよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではスタート"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤純奈→寧々さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年長メンバーでないのに\n冷静さを持ってるところ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子→星野さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"星野さんのテンションを\n更に上げた感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木琴子→ ×"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人見知りで不思議な雰囲気！\n趣味の話になると異様に\nテンションが上がります(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣→ ×"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段は\"お姉さん\"って\n感じなんですが仲良くなると\n甘えてきます(笑)←"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音→生駒さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格というよりは\n身振り手振りが初期の生駒さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寺田蘭世→飛鳥さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか感性が似ているみたい。\nブログとか見てても分かるけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西川七海→衛藤さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンションとか\n人を惹きつける力とか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀未央奈→西野さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野さんの人見知りを\nもう少し弱めた感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"矢田里沙子→深川さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく清楚で優しくて\n乃木坂っぽい雰囲気"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山﨑怜奈→ ×"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ皆さんに見せてる表情は\n通称:表れなち  ってゆう\nしっかりした怜奈なんです！\nおっちょこちょいになる裏れなちを\n皆さんに見ていただきたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"米徳京花→市來さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知的で美人なのに変顔とかしちゃう\nおちゃめなところ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渡辺みり愛→ ×"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は恥ずかしがり屋で\n初対面だと落ち着いてるけど\n仲良くなればなるほど素が出て\nはっちゃける子"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにわたくし伊藤かりんは\n若月さんっぽいかなあ～と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷静にツッコミをいれるとことか←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さん並びにファンの皆様\n申し訳ございません\n＿|￣|○＿|￣|○＿|￣|○＿|￣|○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ無理矢理当てはめた子とかも\nいますけれど...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生に興味を持つきっかけの\n1つになればいいなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の好きな歌は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5位 失いたくないから\nPVの生田さんが頷くシーンが\n好き過ぎて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4位 狼に口笛を\nバースデーライブの演出で\n更に好きになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 ぐるぐるカーテン\n初めて聞いた時のドキドキが\n忘れられない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 音が出ないギター\n曲調も歌詞もすごく好き。\nかっこいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\nイントロで心を持っていかれる。\n本当に名曲！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい曲多過ぎて\n日によってランクは変動します(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットいる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いないです(´･Д･)\nでも動物は好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫はいやあああ(°_°)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母親の作った唐揚げ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはダントツ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは練乳と春巻きとお刺身と\nお肉とゼリーとアイスと......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挙げてたらキリないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに嫌いな食べ物は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネギと炭酸とワサビと\nしょうがとマヨネーズ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柏さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0030.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柏さんと白石さんは\n写メ撮れてないので、\n私のお気に入りの画像"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私のブログ更新日の方のみ\n僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8.21 birth day!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かじかじさん\n千夏さん\nさとさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エピローグ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0033.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カレンダーの\n5/26(私の誕生日)の週は\n一実さんだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0034.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0035.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むにゅ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(いつも長文ブログで\n本当申し訳ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次こそは短く.........！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0036.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0037.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回予告 9月3日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/08/21/9361241/0038.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-29424":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ開いていただいてありがとうございます\nこんにちは！宮田愛萌です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『月刊MOE』を読みまして。\n今回のMOEは「大人のための海外児童文学」ということで、漫画家の羽海野チカさんの赤毛のアンのイラストの表紙です。\n何度か言っていたと思うのですが、私、児童文学とか絵本とか、子どものための本にも興味があるんです。\n子どもの頃に読んだことがあるような有名な児童文学でも、今読んでくると違ったものも見えてきたりやっぱり同じように楽しめたり難しくないので時間がなくてもサラリと読めるのも魅力だし子ども向けならではの大きめの字が並んだずっしり重い本というビジュアルも素敵だし面白いんです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、MOEを読んでまた色々読みたくなってしまって大好きな若草物語を借りてきました。\n持っているんですけどね。別の訳で読みたくなってね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**************************"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月2日の握手会と生誕祭ありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ2QSRDY1JFFJVMWFP71YK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では、2部:キャミワンピース3部:生誕祭Tシャツを着ました〜\n2部のワンピースは、ぜひメチャカリさんのインスタを見てください( ·ᴥ· )💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会では、守屋さんの写真集を予約したと報告して下さる方や、SNSのこの写真が好きだった〜と教えて下さる方が、たくさんいて私はその度にテンションを上げ、なんだか面白い握手会になったような気がします。\n6月26日楽しみですね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、生誕祭本当にありがとうございました！\n握手会にいらして下さった皆さまや、日向坂のメンバーたち❤︎、そして守屋さんが来て下さってこんなにもたくさんの人に囲まれて生誕祭をすることができる私は幸せだなぁと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか、守屋さんがお花を渡して下さるなんて夢にも思ってなくてですね…(いえ、夢で思ったことがない訳ではないけれど…笑)でもほんとうに夢みたいに嬉しくてずっとずっと憧れている先輩で、加入前から好きで、加入してからもっともっと好きになってそんな方から誕生日を祝ってもらえる幸せ！ほんとうに嬉しかったです。\n21歳、守屋さんみたいな女性になりたいです💕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話が全部とんじゃって自分がなにを話しているのかわからないくらい本当に動揺していたので正しく感謝が伝えられなかったですよね。ごめんなさい。でも、本当に本当に私は幸せだなって思って嬉しくて、皆さんへの大好きが止まらないです\n私がこうしてもらった幸せをこれから返していけるのかはわからないけれど皆さんが、好きになって良かったって思えるようになります！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ2RX403YK8K5NM7A0HW1N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHJ2SYNV5TRZBSNPCN476Y0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンでいっぱい写真撮ったよ〜💕📷🎥💥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生において幸せの数が決まっているとしたら確実にそろそろ底を尽きそうなんですけど大丈夫かなと不安になります😌\nまぁでも、ね！\n皆さま、忘れているかもしれませんが、私今年の運勢日向坂最下位なんですよ〜なので最下位になったという悲しさで、まぁ、プラマイゼロ…と思うことにします笑\nというか、最下位でこれって日向坂の運勢良すぎないですか！日本で1番ハッピーなグループなのかな…笑\nなんて、浮かれたことを書いてみたのですが本当に毎日幸せな気持ちでいられるのは紛れもなくいつも私を応援してくださる皆さまのおかげなので、本当にありがとうございます💕\nこれからも、なにとぞ、よろしくお願いします\nお読みいただきありがとうございましたばいみん♪\n   みやた まなも#188"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-hina-40133":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"梅雨があけたので、あしたからほんきだす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ども。ポカです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"といいつつ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きょうはメンバーが配信ミニライブだったり、\nあしたの「音楽の日」の準備でかまってくれないので、とてもヒマなのです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、\nキンキンにひえた事務所で、小坂の写真集みてオタ活中～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0716_0_firfrhfrfhh8gth8f8jf8rfr.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真集ってみるたび発見があっていいよね～\nポカのお気に入りカットはもちろんひみつです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、\n発売記念SHOWROOMにせんにゅーしたときの写真がみつかったのでシェア～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0716_1_dnfrjidehofhwfhrohf.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/poka_0716_2_fisifsiofosiifrjfirsjjrs.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらためまして、\n見ていただいた方、買っていただいた方ありがとうございました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかポカ撮がはつばいされて、\n坂道史上No. 1ヒットを記録するその日まで、ポカも隠しどりがんばります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日はこのへんで～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカ"}],"source":"official"},"v3_886199280b215de575718bd5":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜🔔*゜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202609/mobSZcOK2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！日向坂46  金村美玖です🐞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日9/30は18thシングル\n「イチャイチャ虫」の発売日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速CDをゲットしてくださった方\nストリーミングで曲を聴いてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もMVは3つ公開されています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○イチャイチャ虫🫶\n【https://youtu.be/mgFUz_c4ToM?si=I9ImEiXifW6dSa1B】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○風にキンモクセイ🌬\n【https://youtu.be/QzNd53mcPLU?si=eBxVnPtldDzYWNeY】　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○それでもいつか🎻\n【https://youtu.be/uVgPrRdq4QU?si=wEecBYwQShX2kYt8】　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれ全く違うテイストで、日向坂46の\n楽曲の幅広さ、表現の違いを感じていただけると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにもカップリング曲には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「